// # core/str — String Primitives
//
// Logline: The OoStr family. Retain/release, lit, concat, intern, ops.
//
// Beats:
//   1. str.c — retain, release, alloc_payload, lit, concat, concat_list, concat_multi.
//   2. str_intern.c — ASCII interning + FNV-1a hash interning pool.
//   3. str_from_int.c — dedicated 0..8191 integer interning.
//   4. str_ops.c — eq, contains, starts_with, ends_with, index_of, to_uppercase.
//   5. str_tok.c — token-line builder for error messages.
//   6. str.h — local type defs (oo_str_alloc_payload, oo_str_concat, oo_str_byte_len).
//
// ──▓▓ core/str ANCHOR ──▓▓──
